# Check out LF everywhere, including Windows.
#
# This repository ships a conformance corpus and a lockfile format whose whole job is
# that two machines agree on the same bytes. Git for Windows defaults to converting
# line endings on checkout, which would make a Windows working tree a different
# document from the one the hashes were computed over — for no benefit, since nothing
# here is edited in a tool that needs CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Belt and braces for the files that are read as evidence rather than as text.
*.json   text eol=lf
*.jsonl  text eol=lf
*.yaml   text eol=lf
*.yml    text eol=lf
*.py     text eol=lf
